### BCP PDF Extractor - REST Client Tests
### Variables
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8001

### === HEALTH CHECK ===

### 1. Health Check - Get API Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/api
Accept: application/json

###

### === DATABASE OPERATIONS ===

### 2. Initialize Database (First time setup)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/database/initialize
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 3. Check Database Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/database/status
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Reset Database (DANGER - Deletes all data)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/database/reset
Content-Type: application/json

###

### === PDF PROCESSING WITH DATABASE ===

### 5. Process PDF with Database Integration
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/process-pdf/database
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "pdf_filename": "files/EECC102025_09745280.PDF",
    "type": "debit",
    "user_email": "admin@bcpextractor.com"
}

###

### === PDF PROCESSING (LEGACY) ===

### 6. Process PDF by Name - EECC102025_06878124.PDF (Downloads CSV directly)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/process-pdf
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "pdf_filename": "files/EECC102025_06878124.PDF",
    "type": "debit"
}

###

### 7. Process PDF by Name - EECC102025_06878124.PDF (Returns JSON info)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/process-pdf/info
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "pdf_filename": "files/EECC102025_06878124.PDF"
}

###

### 8. Process PDF by Name - EECC102025_09745280.PDF (Downloads CSV directly)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/process-pdf
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "pdf_filename": "files/EECC102025_09745280.PDF",
    "type": "debit"
}

###

### 9. Process PDF by Name - EECC102025_09745280.PDF (Returns JSON info)  
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/process-pdf/info
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "pdf_filename": "files/EECC102025_09745280.PDF"
}

###

### === OUTPUT FILES ===

### 10. List Output Files
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/output
Accept: application/json

###

### 11. Download CSV Output - EECC102025_06878124
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/output/EECC102025_06878124_transactions.csv

###

### 12. Download CSV Output - EECC102025_09745280
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/output/EECC102025_09745280_transactions.csv

###

### === ERROR TESTING ===

### 13. Test Credit Card PDF (Should return 501 Not Implemented)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/process-pdf
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "pdf_filename": "files/EECC102025_06878124.PDF",
    "type": "credit"
}

###

### 14. Test Invalid Type (Should return 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/process-pdf
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "pdf_filename": "files/EECC102025_06878124.PDF",
    "type": "invalid_type"
}

###